# RAG Eval Studio — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in only what you use.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# ─── HOW PROVIDERS WORK ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LiteLLM routes every call. In the Gradio UI you enter:
#   Provider field  →  "groq"           (or "openai", "anthropic", "ollama", …)
#   Model field     →  "groq/llama3-8b-8192"  (or whichever model)
#   API key field   →  paste key, OR leave blank if set here as env var
#
# Keys set here are auto-detected by LiteLLM — you don't need to type them
# in the UI every time.

# ─── GROQ (recommended — fast, generous free tier) ───────────────────────────
# Models: groq/llama3-8b-8192  groq/llama3-70b-8192  groq/mixtral-8x7b-32768
#         groq/gemma2-9b-it    groq/llama-3.1-8b-instant
# Get key: https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...your_groq_key_here...

# ─── OpenAI (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Models: openai/gpt-4o-mini  openai/gpt-4o  openai/text-embedding-3-small
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...your_openai_key_here...

# ─── Anthropic (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Models: anthropic/claude-3-haiku-20240307  anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...your_anthropic_key_here...

# ─── Cohere (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Models: cohere/embed-english-v3.0  cohere/command-r
# COHERE_API_KEY=...your_cohere_key_here...

# ─── Local Ollama (optional — zero cost, runs offline) ───────────────────────
# Provider: "ollama"   Model: "ollama/llama3"  (no key needed)
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# ─── Server overrides (usually leave as default) ─────────────────────────────
# RAG_EVAL_HOST=127.0.0.1
# RAG_EVAL_PORT=7860
